        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>模型60 与二次函数有关的综合问题(1)</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background-color: #f0e6d8;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", serif;\n    color: #222;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 30px 40px;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 800px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin: 18px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .section-title .bracket {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  table {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  table, th, td {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n  }\n  th {\n    padding: 8px 4px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: normal;\n  }\n  td {\n    padding: 6px 8px;\n    text-align: center;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  td.formula {\n    text-align: center;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  td.desc {\n    text-align: left;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    padding: 10px 10px;\n  }\n  .example-block {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .example-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .options {\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-start;\n    gap: 40px;\n  }\n  .options span {\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">模型 60&nbsp;&nbsp;与二次函数有关的综合问题（1）</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">【模型分析】</div>\n\n  <table>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"width:22%;\">解析式</th>\n      <th style=\"width:22%;\">a 取值</th>\n      <th style=\"width:18%;\">顶点坐标</th>\n      <th style=\"width:16%;\">对称轴</th>\n      <th style=\"width:18%;\">与 y 轴交点</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$y=ax^2$</td>\n      <td class=\"desc\" rowspan=\"4\">\n        当 $a&gt;0$ 时<br>\n        开口向上：在对称<br>\n        轴左侧 $y$ 随 $x$ 增大<br>\n        而减小，在对称轴<br>\n        的右侧 $y$ 随 $x$ 增大<br>\n        而增大。<br>\n        当 $a&lt;0$ 时<br>\n        开口向下：在对称<br>\n        轴左侧 $y$ 随 $x$ 增大<br>\n        而增大，在对称轴<br>\n        的右侧 $y$ 随 $x$ 增大<br>\n        而减小。\n      </td>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$(0,0)$</td>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$x=0$</td>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$(0,0)$</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$y=ax^2+k$</td>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$(0,c)$</td>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$x=0$</td>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$(0,\\ k)$</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$y=a(x+h)^2$</td>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$(-h,0)$</td>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$x=-h$</td>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$(0,\\ ah^2)$</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$y=a(x+h)^2+k$</td>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$(-h,\\ k)$</td>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$x=-h$</td>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$(0,\\ ah^2+k)$</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$y=ax^2+bx+c$</td>\n      <td class=\"desc\">\n        开口向上：在对称<br>\n        轴左侧 $y$ 随 $x$ 增大<br>\n        而增大，在对称轴<br>\n        的右侧 $y$ 随 $x$ 增大<br>\n        而减小。\n      </td>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$\\left(-\\dfrac{b}{2a},\\ \\dfrac{4ac-b^2}{4a}\\right)$</td>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$x=-\\dfrac{b}{2a}$</td>\n      <td class=\"formula\">$(0,\\ c)$</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">【经典例题】</div>\n\n  <div class=\"example-block\">\n    <span class=\"example-title\">例1.（2020·福建九年级零模）</span>若二次函数 $y=\\left|ax^2+bx+c\\right|$（$c&lt;-5$ 且 $0&lt;a&lt;\\dfrac{3}{2}$）过\n    $A(m,n)$，$B(3,y_1)$，$C(2-m,n)$，$D\\left(-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2},y_2\\right)$，$E(1,y_3)$，且 $AC$ 到对称轴的距离相\n    等 $n\\neq0$，则 $y_1$、$y_2$、$y_3$ 的大小关系是（&nbsp;&nbsp;）\n\n    <div class=\"options\">\n      <span>A. $y_3&gt;y_1&gt;y_2$</span>\n      <span>B. $y_3&gt;y_2&gt;y_1$</span>\n      <span>C. $y_1&gt;y_2&gt;y_3$</span>\n      <span>D. $y_3&lt;y_1&lt;y_2$</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
